D65. A steal magnate that travels in a lower berth (Fr-8 air-conditioned). ~ HOBO
D67. If you had a little dough you might make this. ~ TART
D69. This spends all of the time on the Mediterranean. ~ NICE
D72. Describes ownership after marriage. ~ OUR
D75. If you can't make a theme from this article, put me on to it. ~ THE
D78. If you haven't time enough, put me on to this too. ~ TI
D80. The fellow responsible for "many snappy returns." (abbr.) ~ ED


